## Dimension 3: Security

### Applicable Guardrails
- **AUTH-004:** Authorization Required — ingestion endpoints authenticated; source systems use agreed authentication mechanisms per integration type
- **SEC-001:** TLS Encryption — all source-to-inbox transport over TLS 1.2+
- **SEC-002:** No Secrets in Code — source system credentials, API keys, and certificates stored in Azure Key Vault

### Security Requirements
- Each inbound integration authenticated at the source connection level (not open listeners)
- Source credentials rotated per NHS / vendor security requirements
- Ingestion pipeline validates document provenance before placing in inbox (source identity cannot be spoofed by malformed metadata)
- NHSmail integration security model subject to NHS England access agreement (currently unresolved — parked; see Parking Lot in manifest.md)

