### CHECK 1: CLIN-010 — Per-Source Partial Degradation (Not Full Inbox Block)
- **Trigger:** One or more inbound sources becomes unavailable
- **Test Scenario:** Single source failure
  - Simulate: MESH source returns error / times out
  - Validation 1: Inbox renders and displays documents from all other functioning sources
  - Validation 2: Inbox does NOT display a full error/blocked state
  - Validation 3: No source-availability banner is rendered in the inbox UI
  - Validation 4: Source failure event is emitted to telemetry/logging with source identifier
- **Guardrail:** CLIN-010, CLIN-007
- **Hazard:** HAZ-DOC-006
- **Pass Criteria:** Inbox remains functional with partial source failure; no user-facing source banner shown; failure still recorded in telemetry/logs

### CHECK 2: CLIN-007 — No User-Facing Source Availability Banner in Core Scope
