### Accessibility Requirements (WCAG 2.1 AA)

**Stored-copy Banner:**
- [x] Perceivable: warning conveyed by `variant="warning"` icon + text, not colour alone
- [x] Operable: dismiss button keyboard accessible (Tab → Enter/Space); not auto-dismissed
- [x] Understandable: plain English message; no jargon
- [x] Robust: `Banner` component is `@emisgroup/ui-banner`; no native `<div>` role override needed

**Rule B — loading/status announcements:**
```tsx
